sequenceDiagram
    actor Passenger
    participant Inventory as Phase 6 Inventory
    participant Reservation as Phase 7 Reservation
    participant Booking as Phase 8 Booking
    participant DB as Shared PostgreSQL
    Passenger->>Inventory: Create one owned hold per passenger
    Inventory-->>Passenger: Active hold references
    Passenger->>Reservation: Create request and allocate holds
    Reservation->>DB: Transfer claims atomically to provisional allocations
    Reservation-->>Passenger: ALLOCATED_PENDING_BOOKING and assigned berths
    Passenger->>Booking: Create booking from quote and reservation IDs
    Booking->>Reservation: Verify owner and provisional allocation
    Booking->>DB: Persist snapshots and booking, attach booking ID
    DB-->>Booking: Commit booking and allocation association atomically
    Booking-->>Passenger: AWAITING_PAYMENT booking details
